    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Opportunity Discovery Engine v1\n\nDaily Google Places text search per enabled segment term (leads.segments.search_terms), deduped upsert into leads.candidates. Run tracking in leads.discovery_runs.\n\n**Credentials required:**\n1. IVNautomation Postgres \u2014 host: ivnautomation-postgres, db: ivnautomation, user: ivan\n2. Google Places API Key \u2014 httpHeaderAuth, header name: X-Goog-Api-Key",
        "height": 664,
        "width": 1876,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "bf3ff5ef-7819-4b41-81bd-7cf954c701a7",
      "name": "Sticky Note e88c5ed3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
